{"articleNo":"153812","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=153812&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2016-2학기 국가장학금 성적기준 알림","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2016.07.04","hit":"6717","attachments":[{"name":"2016-2 국가장학금 시행계획(안).hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=153812&attachNo=4625"},{"name":"2016-2 국가장학금 성적심사 기준.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=153812&attachNo=5022"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"view_content\" class=\"view_content\"><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">국가장학금의 성적 산출 기준을 붙임과 알려드리오니 참고 하시기 바랍니다.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">특히, 성적 포기시 학점기준을 잘 숙지 하여 직전학기(2016-1학기)기준으로</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">장학금 수혜를 받더라도 2016.7~ 12월 중 성적을 포기하여 학점이 변동 즉 12</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">학점 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">미만시 장학금 전액 회수됨을 알려드립니다.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">예시)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">※ </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.2pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕\"><span>이수학점은 취득학점 기준</span></span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.2pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양중고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.2pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕\">신청학점 기준 적용불가</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.2pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양중고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.2pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕\">이며</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.2pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양중고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.2pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕\">이수학점 산출 시 수강신청 정정기간 내 취소과목</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.2pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양중고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">, F</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.2pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕\">학점</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.2pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양중고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.2pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕\">이수 후 포기 과목은 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.6pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕\">미반영</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.6pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양중고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.6pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕\">소속대학 최저 이수학점이 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.6pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양중고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">12</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.6pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕\">학점 미만인 경우</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.6pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양중고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.6pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕\">대학</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.2pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"> </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.2pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕\">학사규정에 의함</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.2pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양중고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.2pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양중고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.9pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양중고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.9pt; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕\">예</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.9pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양중고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">1)</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-tab-count: 1\"> </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.9pt; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕\">직전학기 성적이 최종 신청학점 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.9pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양중고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">14</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.9pt; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕\">학점</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.9pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양중고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.9pt; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕\">학기말 성적 취득 시 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.9pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양중고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">3</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.9pt; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕\">학점 과목 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.9pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양중고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">“F”</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.9pt; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕\">존재하여 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.9pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양중고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">F</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.9pt; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕\">포함 백분위 성적 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.9pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양중고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">78</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.9pt; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕\">점</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.9pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양중고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">, F</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.9pt; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕\">제외 백분위 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.9pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양중고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">82</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.9pt; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕\">점</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.9pt; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕\"></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><font color=\"#0900ff\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.9pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">☞ </span></span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.9pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕\">백분위 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.9pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양중고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">78(F</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.9pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕\">과목 포함</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.9pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양중고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">), </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.9pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕\">이수학점 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.9pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양중고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">11(F</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.9pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕\">과목 제외</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.9pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양중고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">) -&gt; 국가장학금 반납 대상</span></span></font></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.9pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양중고딕\" lang=\"EN-U